                                                                    <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=" font-weight:700;"&gt;Scene Change Detection Threshold&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; - Lower number: &lt;span style=" font-weight:700;"&gt;higher&lt;/span&gt; chance of detecting scene changes, with risk of &lt;span style=" font-weight:700;"&gt;overdetection&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; - Higher number: &lt;span style=" font-weight:700;"&gt;lower &lt;/span&gt;chance of detecting scene changes, with risk of &lt;span style=" font-weight:700;"&gt;underdetection.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;   - &lt;span style=" font-weight:700;"&gt;Recommended: &lt;/span&gt;2-3 for real life, 4 for animation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
                                                                   </property>
                                 </widget>
                                </item>
