                                                               <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;Auto HDR Mode&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Auto enables HDR mode if RVE detects that the video that is being rendered is HDR. &lt;span style=" font-weight:700;"&gt;This will cause slower rendering if the video is HDR.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=" font-weight:700;"&gt; - &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=" font-weight:700;"&gt;HDR is only color tested on x264 and x265 encoders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=" ont-weight:700"&gt; - The preview colors may be distorted as the preview itself is not HDR.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
